  {`summary`: "Bryan, wearing a black cap and a pink name tag, is interviewed in a hallway and later in a room with tables. He discusses Sourcify, a multimedia knowledge-base side project for marketing that helps him learn new technology and is aimed at businesses.", `id`: "6a6bb525c1ac59f5d1d11244#0", `transcript`: "The interviewer asks Bryan about his work on a multimedia knowledge base for marketing, his company Sourcify, and his target audience. Bryan explains that it is a side project to learn new technology and that it targets businesses.", `idx`: 0, `start_sec`: 0.0, `domain`: "video-context-graph", `video_id`: "6a6bb525c1ac59f5d1d11244", `on_screen_text`: "Bryan", `end_sec`: 106.0},
