  {`summary`: "The camera pans across the hackathon room, where multiple participants work on laptops at tables. Large displays show blue screens with AWS branding while the interviewer says they need to speak with more people and briefly discusses a project's functionality off-camera.", `id`: "6a6bb525c1ac59f5d1d11244#2", `transcript`: "The interviewer mentions needing to talk to more people and briefly discusses the functionality of a project with someone off-camera.", `idx`: 2, `start_sec`: 260.0, `domain`: "video-context-graph", `video_id`: "6a6bb525c1ac59f5d1d11244", `on_screen_text`: "AWS", `end_sec`: 300.0},
  {`summary`: "A man wearing glasses, a black T-shirt with a ghost logo, and a blue lanyard speaks and gestures while holding a white mug with an orange-and-yellow pixelated design. People sit at tables with laptops in a room with large windows and a ceiling-mounted projector.", `id`: "6a6bb525c1ac59f5d1d11244#3", `transcript`: "", `idx`: 3, `start_sec`: 300.0, `domain`: "video-context-graph", `video_id`: "6a6bb525c1ac59f5d1d11244", `on_screen_text`: "", `end_sec`: 534.0},
  {`summary`: "The camera briefly pans to a woman with long dark hair, wearing a black T-shirt and blue lanyard, who also speaks. The discussion continues around AI-related projects, Meta Ray-Bans, AWS, and Strands Agents.", `id`: "6a6bb525c1ac59f5d1d11244#4", `transcript`: "", `idx`: 4, `start_sec`: 534.0, `domain`: "video-context-graph", `video_id`: "6a6bb525c1ac59f5d1d11244", `on_screen_text`: "", `end_sec`: 600.0},
  {`summary`: "A bearded man wearing glasses, a black ghost-logo T-shirt, and a blue lanyard speaks while holding a white mug with an orange pixel design. He describes an agent project using GPS coordinates and Wikipedia lookups, a persona drop-down menu, and a Times Square demo. He also shares that he is from North Carolina, is active in San Francisco networking, and is building a hacker community at Cornell.", `id`: "6a6bb525c1ac59f5d1d11244#5", `transcript`: "The speaker discusses a project involving an agent, GPS coordinates, a Wikipedia lookup, a persona drop-down menu, and a demo in Times Square. He says he is from North Carolina and talks about networking in San Francisco and building a hacker community at Cornell.", `idx`: 5, `start_sec`: 600.0, `domain`: "video-context-graph", `video_id`: "6a6bb525c1ac59f5d1d11244", `on_screen_text`: "", `end_sec`: 818.0},
