  {`summary`: "A bald man wearing glasses, a black shirt with a white ghost logo, and a light-blue lanyard speaks while holding a pixel-patterned mug. He describes an agent that uses GPS coordinates and Wikipedia lookup, including a persona menu that can make it \"super snarky.\" He recounts demonstrating it in Times Square, says he is from North Carolina rather than Austin, and explains that he is spending the summer in San Francisco to network and help build a hacker community at Cornell University.", `id`: "6a6bc708c1ac59f5d1d1bfff#18", `transcript`: "The speaker discusses a project involving an agent, GPS coordinates, and a Wikipedia lookup. He mentions a persona drop-down menu to make the agent \"super snarky\" and describes a demo in Times Square. He says he is from North Carolina, not Austin, and is in San Francisco for the summer to network and build a hacker community at Cornell.", `idx`: 18, `start_sec`: 600.0, `domain`: "video-context-graph", `video_id`: "6a6bc708c1ac59f5d1d1bfff", `on_screen_text`: "", `end_sec`: 818.0},
  {`summary`: "The camera moves to a collaborative-workspace table with Alton, a mustached man in a white shirt, alongside a man using a laptop and a woman in a purple top. Alton introduces himself, says he is working on a hackathon and testing 12 Labs, and proposes a note-taking device that distinguishes people and remembers their names and faces. He also mentions mountain biking and gardening.", `id`: "6a6bc708c1ac59f5d1d1bfff#19", `transcript`: "Alton introduces himself and says he is working on a hackathon and testing 12 Labs. He discusses an idea for a note-taking device that can differentiate between people and remember names and faces. He mentions mountain biking and gardening as hobbies.", `idx`: 19, `start_sec`: 818.0, `domain`: "video-context-graph", `video_id`: "6a6bc708c1ac59f5d1d1bfff", `on_screen_text`: "AWS Builder Loft", `end_sec`: 900.0}
] AS row
MERGE (n:Segment {id: row.id})
SET n += row;

